<title>HUNGARY: Hungary three-month T-bill yield drops to 21.63pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary three-month T-bill yield drops to 21.63pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on Hungary's three-month discount treasury bills was set by auction at 21.63 percent, down from 21.71 percent at an auction one week ago, the Government Debt Management Agency said on Wednesday on its Reuters page.</p>
<p>    Total on offer     0     5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received     12,191.97 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	   5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    21.63 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     94.8832 pct</p>
</text>
